<title>USA: IPO FILING - 800-JR Cigar Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - 800-JR Cigar Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 800-JR Cigar Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			JRJR.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   N/A</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    3.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 3.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after IPO    N/A</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Prudential Securities Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters overallotment  450,000 shrs Business: Based in Whippany, NJ., the company is a distributor and retailer of tobacco and tobacco-related products in North America.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: To finance development, construction and other costs related to a new warehouse, new stores and store renovations; to finance expansion of direct mail operations, repay long-term debt, working capital and general corporate purposes, among others.</p>
